{"run_id": "20260802T232211-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-8d9a48a2", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which simulated samples does analysis 2602.18611 use?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2602.18611 uses the following simulated samples:\n\n- EFT2Obs MadGraph5_aMC@NLO (v2.6.7)/Pythia8 (v8.306) samples used for SMEFT reweighting\n- Reference LO POWHEG sample for gluon-initiated ZH (ggZH) production\n- Reference NLO POWHEG v2 MiNLO samples for quark-initiated VH production (WH, qqZH)\n- Reference NLO QCD MadGraph5_aMC@NLO samples for ggH, VBF, ttH, and tH production (v2.4.2)\n- SMEFT@NLO loop-level samples for ggH, ggZH, and H->gg processes\n- SMEFTsim 3.0 tree-level samples for remaining SMEFT production and decay processes\n\nThese samples are used in various parts of the analysis to simulate different physics processes and scenarios.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2602.18611"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2602.18611"], "predicate": "result_uses_sample"}, "rows": 6, "error": null, "seconds": 0.005}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:sample:eft2obs_reweighting_sample", "hepkg:sample:ref_ggh_vbf_tth_th_mg5amcnlo", "hepkg:sample:ref_ggzh_lo_powheg", "hepkg:sample:ref_vh_qq_powheg_minlo", "hepkg:sample:smeft_loop_ggh_ggzh_hgg", "hepkg:sample:smeft_tree_remaining"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:196c5b604e0cdc67c28f2aa3", "hepkg:evidence:602761a084ae811f12b5004e", "hepkg:evidence:a841a76b71316e1892e1df5e"], "seen_values": ["2", "2.4.2", "2.6.7", "2602.18611", "3", "3.0", "8.306", "and", "decay", "eft2obs", "for", "ggh", "ggzh", "gluon-initiated", "hepkg:sample:eft2obs_reweighting_sample", "hepkg:sample:ref_ggh_vbf_tth_th_mg5amcnlo", "hepkg:sample:ref_ggzh_lo_powheg", "hepkg:sample:ref_vh_qq_powheg_minlo", "hepkg:sample:smeft_loop_ggh_ggzh_hgg", "hepkg:sample:smeft_tree_remaining", "loop-level", "madgraph5_amc", "minlo", "nlo", "powheg", "processes", "production", "pythia8", "qcd", "qqzh", "quark-initiated", "reference", "remaining", "result_uses_sample", "reweighting", "sample", "samples", "smeft", "smeftsim", "tree-level", "tth", "used", "vbf"], "verification_score": 0.4, "unsupported_claims": ["6.7", "306", "4.2"], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7359, "completion_tokens": 244, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 9.699933291005436, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 9.699933291005436, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 7603.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 0.4, "unsupported_claims": 3.0, "retrieved_label_recall": 1.0, "retrieved_entities": 6.0, "mentioned_label_recall": 1.0, "truncation_loss_labels": 0.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 6.0, "evidence_quotes": 3.0}}
{"run_id": "20260802T232211-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-921c0274", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which observables does analysis 2004.01678 measure?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2004.01678 measures the following observables:\n\n- σ(pp→H)×B(H→ZJ/ψ)\n- σ(pp→H)×B(H→Za), B(a→gg)=100%\n- σ(pp→H)×B(H→Za), B(a→s̄s̄)=100%\n- σ(pp→H)×B(H→Zη_c)\n\nThese are the cross-sections times branching ratios for various decay modes of the Higgs boson into a Z boson and another particle (J/ψ, a pseudoscalar meson decaying to gluons, a pseudoscalar meson decaying to strange quarks, and η_c). \n\nThis information is directly from the paper 2004.01678.\n\nAnswered from the graph.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2004.01678"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 4, "error": null, "seconds": 0.003}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:observable:xsec-br-h-to-z-etac", "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-h-to-z-jpsi", "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-h-to-za-gg", "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-h-to-za-ss"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:7e921623cac7e5353888dbf1", "hepkg:evidence:a09dfb0acc993fdcaf93da8f"], "seen_values": ["1", "100", "2004.01678", "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-h-to-z-etac", "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-h-to-z-jpsi", "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-h-to-za-gg", "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-h-to-za-ss", "observable", "result_measures_observable"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7159, "completion_tokens": 226, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 8.992273500014562, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 8.992273500014562, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 7385.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims":