{"run_id": "20260802T232211-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-a97f40c8", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which collision systems does analysis 2404.06204 study?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2404.06204 studies the following collision systems:\n\n- pp collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s} = 13\\) TeV\n- pp collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s} = 5.02\\) TeV\n\nThese details are supported by the following entries in the graph:\n\n- For \\(\\sqrt{s} = 13\\) TeV: \n  - Object ID: `hepkg:collision_system:pp-13tev`\n  - Kind: `collision_system`\n\n- For \\(\\sqrt{s} = 5.02\\) TeV:\n  - Object ID: `hepkg:collision_system:pp-5p02tev`\n  - Kind: `collision_system`\n\nTherefore, the analysis 2404.06204 covers both collision systems.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2202.08676", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2211.08028", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2407.10549", "2503.19420", "2508.13900"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2404.06204"], "predicate": "result_has_collision_system"}, "rows": 2, "error": null, "seconds": 0.002}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:collision_system:pp-13tev", "hepkg:collision_system:pp-5p02tev"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:0b9efe8df38e31fd3c41d8b5"], "seen_values": ["13", "2404.06204", "5.02", "collision_system", "collisions", "hepkg:collision_system:pp-13tev", "hepkg:collision_system:pp-5p02tev", "result_has_collision_system", "sqrt", "tev"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7001, "completion_tokens": 441, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 17.542239666974638, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 17.542239666974638, "llm_calls": 2