{"run_id": "20260802T232211-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-b2c9a1cd", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many object selection requirements does analysis 2008.05928 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2008.05928 defines 12 object selection requirements. Here are all the selection requirements:\n\n- MV2c10 b-tagging working point at 77% efficiency\n- Exactly two c.m. subjets reconstructed per large-R jet via EEkT algorithm in jet rest frame\n- Formed from the highest-pT photon and highest-pT large-R jet in the event\n- mH - Δ_m,D < mJ < mH + Δ_m,U (mH = 125.80 GeV), with Δ_m,D and Δ_m,U parameterized as fourth-order polynomials of jet pT\n- pT > 200 GeV; |η| < 1.37 (calorimeter barrel region)\n- pT > 200 GeV; |η| < 2.0; 50 GeV < mJ < 200 GeV; ΔR > 1.0 from photon; count ≥ 1\n- pT_J > 0.8 * (pT0 + a * mJγ), with pT0 = 12.0(121.8) GeV and a = 0.35(0.22) for single-b-tagged (double-b-tagged) category\n- pT_γ > pT0 + a * mJγ, with pT0 = 12.0(121.8) GeV and a = 0.35(0.22) for single-b-tagged (double-b-tagged) category\n- Tight photon identification and isolation; count ≥ 1\n- Track associated to c.m. subjet if opening angle Δθ (in jet rest frame) satisfies 2 * (1 - cos(Δθ)) < 0.8\n- ≥1 of the two c.m. subjets in the large-R jet pass the b-tagging requirement (single-b-tagged category); both pass (double-b-tagged category)", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2008.05928"], "predicate": "object_has_selection"}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "seconds": 0.007}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:0f71a427bff85a7428808ff8", "hepkg:evidence:14f6dd94134d1b0ab7290a87", "hepkg:evidence:185c7b72ed111a07aa378f6f", "hepkg:evidence:4528c331be216ec776ede336", "hepkg:evidence:9a731f45a5e0a6c8f7e865d1", "hepkg:evidence:aab9b930efbe7fbc1cc