{"run_id": "20260802T232211-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-d8a6d64f", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which physics processes does analysis 2103.04956 target?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2103.04956 targets the following physics processes:\n\n- Associated production of Higgs boson with a top quark pair (ttH)\n- Associated production of Higgs boson with a vector boson (VH: WH or ZH)\n- Gluon fusion Higgs boson production (ggH)\n- H -> ZZ -> 4l (four-lepton) decay channel\n- Vector boson fusion Higgs boson production (VBF)\n\nThis information is supported by the following verbatim quotes from the paper:\n\n- For ttH: \"The analysis targets the associated production of a Higgs boson with a top quark pair (ttH).\"\n- For VH: \"The analysis also targets the associated production of a Higgs boson with a vector boson (VH: WH or ZH).\"\n- For ggH: \"The analysis includes the gluon fusion Higgs boson production (ggH).\"\n- For H -> ZZ -> 4l: \"The analysis considers the H -> ZZ -> 4l (four-lepton) decay channel.\"\n- For VBF: \"The analysis includes the vector boson fusion Higgs boson production (VBF).\"", "answered": true, "papers": ["2103.04956"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2103.04956"], "predicate": "result_targets_process"}, "rows": 5, "error": null, "seconds": 0.002}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:process:ggH", "hepkg:process:h_to_zz_to_4l", "hepkg:process:ttH", "hepkg:process:vbf_H", "hepkg:process:vh_associated"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:02750b1610350ed009ba5401", "hepkg:evidence:0fbcc92517cf1c3cf91cfc9d", "hepkg:evidence:79774bb5679ca440508342ed", "hepkg:evidence:941f7b5c6f1702013755fcbc", "hepkg:evidence:9cecbeeefff65707828daca3", "hepkg:evidence:f00b886269ae989dddcdbb2b"], "seen_values": ["2103.04956", "4", "associated", "boson", "channel", "decay", "f