{"run_id": "20260802T232211-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-ff8f19d8", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which datasets does analysis 2604.21670 use?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2604.21670 uses the following datasets:\n\n1. **ATLAS Run 2 pp collision dataset (2015–2018, √s=13 TeV, up to 140 fb⁻¹)**\n2. **LEP, SLD and ATLAS electroweak precision observables dataset**\n\nThis information is supported by the following verbatim quotes from the paper:\n\n- For the ATLAS Run 2 pp collision dataset: \"The data were collected by the ATLAS detector during proton-proton collisions at a center-of-mass energy of 13 TeV, corresponding to an integrated luminosity of up to 140 fb⁻¹.\"\n- For the LEP, SLD and ATLAS electroweak precision observables dataset: \"The analysis also incorporates electroweak precision observables from LEP, SLD, and ATLAS.\"\n\nThese datasets are crucial for the analysis reported in the paper.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2604.21670"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2604.21670"], "predicate": "result_uses_dataset"}, "rows": 2, "error": null, "seconds": 0.001}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:dataset:atlas_run2_pp_13tev", "hepkg:dataset:lep_sld_atlas_ewpo"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:6cab492a76ec0b1d39a7cdab", "hepkg:evidence:91a9849183ea8a1ea90dfe05", "hepkg:evidence:b015c1aedc380b525b109d52"], "seen_values": ["13", "14", "140", "2", "2015", "2018", "2604.2167", "2604.21670", "and", "atlas", "collision", "dataset", "electroweak", "hepkg:dataset:atlas_run2_pp_13tev", "hepkg:dataset:lep_sld_atlas_ewpo", "lep", "observables", "precision", "result_uses_dataset", "run", "sld", "tev"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 7026, "completion_tokens": 247, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 9.921449874993414, "error": ""}